   \]

2. **Moles of oxygen:**
   \[
   \text{Moles of oxygen} = \frac{\text{Mass of oxygen}}{\text{Molar mass of oxygen}} = \frac{62.5 \text{ g}}{32 \text{ g/mol}} = 1.95 \text{ mol}
   \]

