   \]

   (Note: The mass of SO₂ is equal to the mass of sulfur because all oxygen is completely reacted.)

5. **Mass of residual gases:**
   \[
   \text{Mass of residual gases} = \text{Mass of air} - \text{Mass of sulfur} = 250 \text{ g} - 31.2 \text{ g} = 218.8 \text{ g}
   \]

