   For \( (A \setminus B) \cup (B \setminus A) \subseteq A \), both \( (A \setminus B) \) and \( (B \setminus A) \) must satisfy the inequality \( (A \setminus B) \leq A \) and \( (B \setminus A) \leq A \).

