","1. **Thermal de Broglie wavelength (\(\lambda\))**:
   The thermal de Broglie wavelength is given by:
   \[
   \lambda = \frac{h}{2\pi k T} \sqrt{\frac{m}{2\pi k T}} = \frac{h}{2\pi k T} \sqrt{\frac{m}{2\pi k T}} = \frac{h}{2\pi k T} \left( \frac{m}{2\pi k T} \right)^{1/2}.
